  m_text: '<size=150%><b>WELCOME, VISITOR</b></size>


    The humans are gone. We
    gathered their machines from the ruins of their planet and the edges of their
    solar system, and brought them here. Step through the hatch to see how their
    technology changed their lives, and how it carried them off their planet.'
