  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MuseumExhibit
  title: MacBook Pro (laptop)
  meta: "Recovered from a caf\xE9 table  \xB7  First MacBook Pro announced January
    2006"
  body: "A laptop folded a whole computer (screen, keyboard, battery and processor)
    into something a human could carry under one arm. Work, study and art no longer
    needed a fixed desk: a caf\xE9, a train or a bed could become an office or a
    studio."
  themeLink: After the phone in the pocket came the computer in the bag. Their technology
    began following them wherever they went, instead of humans going to the machine.
  credit: 'Model: "Laptop / MacBook Pro" by Alex Safayan, CC BY 3.0, via Poly Pizza.
    Simplified low-poly model.'
