  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8c78a3dc61624f33b78b8b42697355c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MuseumExhibit
  title: Information Desk
  meta: "Lobby  \xB7  Start here"
  body: 'Welcome, visitor. The humans who made these objects are extinct. We collected
    what they left behind and arranged it as a journey: how their technology moved
    closer and closer to their bodies, and finally carried them off their planet.


    <b>Route</b>

    1 
    Lobby: the Turntable and the Synthesizer, sounds of Earth

    2  In the pocket:
    iPhone, MacBook

    3  On the body: Wearables, the Spacesuit (try it on)

    4 
    Leaving the ground: the 757 Flight Deck, the Space Station

    5  Mars: the
    Lander and the Perseverance rover at the centre

    6  The balcony: Where Earth
    Was, with a telescope


    Walk up to any glowing ring and press E to read.
    Allow about 15 minutes.'
  themeLink: Every object here was once ordinary for a human. Together they tell
    how a species turned its tools into a way off its own world.
  credit: Desk and hologram built from Unity primitives.
  image: {fileID: 0}
  interactPoint: {fileID: 0}
  interactRange: 2.6
  model: {fileID: 931812905}
  idleSpin: 10
